---
layout: layouts/product.njk
permalink: /developers/lookups/
title: "Caller and Carrier Lookup for developers"
description: "CNAM, caller-ID, LRN, and carrier-of-record intelligence — make smarter routing, screening, and rating decisions before a call is answered."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Developers · Lookups</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Enrich your application with caller and carrier intelligence.</h1>
			<p class="lede">VoiceTel's lookup services help developers make smarter decisions before a call is answered, routed, rated, or risk-scored. Combine caller identity and carrier routing data into screen pops, fraud checks, and rating workflows.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/signup/">Start building {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="/docs/api/">API documentation</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			<div class="terminal-tabs" data-tabs>
				<div class="tab-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Lookup API requests and responses">
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-cnam-request" aria-controls="panel-cnam-request" aria-selected="true">CNAM request</button>
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-cnam-response" aria-controls="panel-cnam-response" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">CNAM response</button>
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-lrn-request" aria-controls="panel-lrn-request" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">LRN request</button>
					<button type="button" class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-lrn-response" aria-controls="panel-lrn-response" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">LRN response</button>
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-cnam-request" aria-labelledby="tab-cnam-request">
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X GET 'https://api.voicetel.com/v2.2/cnam/2025551234' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "cnam.sh", pill: "GET /v2.2/cnam/{number}", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-cnam-response" aria-labelledby="tab-cnam-response" hidden>
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "json" %}{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "number": "2025551234",
    "cnam": "VOICETEL"
  }
}{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "cnam.json", pill: "200 OK", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-lrn-request" aria-labelledby="tab-lrn-request" hidden>
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "bash" %}curl -X GET 'https://api.voicetel.com/v2.2/lrn/2025551234/4155550100' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY'{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "lrn.sh", pill: "GET /v2.2/lrn/{destination}/{ani}", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
				<div role="tabpanel" id="panel-lrn-response" aria-labelledby="tab-lrn-response" hidden>
					{%- set code %}{% highlight "json" %}{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "destination": "2025551234",
    "ani": "4155550100",
    "lrn": {
      "LRN": "12125550000",
      "STATE": "NY",
      "JURISDICTION": "INTERSTATE",
      "LOCAL": "N",
      "LATA": "132",
      "OCN": "9101",
      "CITY": "NEW YORK"
    }
  }
}{% endhighlight %}{% endset %}
					{%- set terminal = { label: "lrn.json", pill: "200 OK", code: code } %}
					{% include "partials/v2/terminal.njk" %}
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="caller-lookup" aria-labelledby="caller-lookup-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Caller Lookup</p>
				<h2 id="caller-lookup-heading">CNAM and caller-ID data before the conversation begins.</h2>
				<p class="lede">Caller Lookup enriches phone numbers with CNAM and caller-ID information so applications can display caller names, inform routing decisions, screen inbound traffic, or prepare CRM screen pops. It returns the Caller ID Name registered for the given 10-digit number. Billed per lookup; requires CNAM service to be enabled.</p>
				<p class="row__links">Full reference: <a href="{{ apiSpecs['v2.2'].urlPath }}#operation/cnamLookup">VoiceTel API v2.2 &rsaquo; CNAM lookup</a>.</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/caller-lookup/">Caller Lookup overview</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set kpis = [
					{ label: "Returns", value: "CNAM", sub: "Caller ID Name registered for the number" },
					{ label: "Input", value: "10", suffix: "digits", sub: "e.g. 2025551234" },
					{ label: "Billing", value: "Per lookup", sub: "Requires CNAM service enabled" },
					{ label: "Sample result", value: "VOICETEL", sub: "cnam for 2025551234" }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/kpi-grid.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<h3 class="subsection-heading">Caller Lookup use cases</h3>
		{%- set featureHeading = "h4" %}
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "person-vcard", title: "Agent screen pops", body: "Display caller identity before the conversation starts." },
			{ icon: "shield-check", title: "Inbound screening", body: "Use caller identity as one signal in spam, fraud, and escalation decisions." },
			{ icon: "diagram-3", title: "Routing context", body: "Route known business callers, customers, anonymous callers, or high-priority contacts into different workflows." },
			{ icon: "list-check", title: "Batch hygiene", body: "Clean lists before campaigns, migrations, or CRM updates." }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white" id="carrier-lookup" aria-labelledby="carrier-lookup-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row row--reverse">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Carrier Lookup</p>
				<h2 id="carrier-lookup-heading">LRN, portability, and carrier-of-record context for routing and rating.</h2>
				<p class="lede">Carrier Lookup returns routing intelligence such as LRN, mobile portability, and carrier-of-record context. Use that data during signup, fraud checks, call setup, support workflows, or routing decisions. The path takes the destination number followed by the calling ANI; both are required to compute jurisdiction and LATA correctly.</p>
				<p class="row__links">Full reference: <a href="{{ apiSpecs['v2.2'].urlPath }}#operation/lrnLookup">VoiceTel API v2.2 &rsaquo; LRN lookup</a>.</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/carrier-lookup/">Carrier Lookup overview</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set rows = [
					{ title: "LRN", meta: "location routing number", state: "Returned" },
					{ title: "Mobile portability", meta: "ported-number context", state: "Returned" },
					{ title: "Carrier of record", meta: "OCN and state", state: "Returned" },
					{ title: "Jurisdiction and LATA", meta: "computed from destination and ANI", state: "Returned" },
					{ title: "Inputs", meta: "destination number, then calling ANI", state: "Both required", neutral: true }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/status-card.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<h3 class="subsection-heading">Carrier Lookup use cases</h3>
		{%- set featureHeading = "h4" %}
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "broadcast-pin", title: "Real-time call setup", body: "Query numbers before routing traffic." },
			{ icon: "shield-check", title: "Fraud and risk checks", body: "Compare carrier and portability signals against user behavior." },
			{ icon: "headset", title: "Support troubleshooting", body: "Give operations teams a portal-based lookup path for manual investigation." },
			{ icon: "tag", title: "Routing and rating decisions", body: "Use carrier-of-record and portability signals as inputs to telecom workflows." }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">Make smarter decisions before the call connects.</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">Caller identity plus carrier-of-record context, queried in real time or in batch. Once you have an API key, run <code>cnamLookup</code> and <code>lrnLookup</code> live from the browser in the API playground; the key stays encrypted to your device, never readable from the page.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/signup/">Try for free {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/docs/api/v2.2/playground/">Open the playground</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
